- Acceptance freezes compiled prompts/grants/target evidence and records the irreversible transition.
- Only afterward may `reviewer-agent` materialize the accepted mirror/workspaces and execute opaque accepted bytes/grants. It never resolves target/materials, compiles prompts, or decides lifecycle.

